  «text (0,4200) 1.4 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿PWM MODULATOR - HRTIM-style comparators of one converter"Â»
  «text (0,3800) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Top FET on while RAMP < D - Tdead/Tsw, bottom FET on while D < RAMP < 1 - Tdead/Tsw: Tdead is cut from both edges of every pulse."Â»
  «text (0,3600) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿RAMPA / RAMPB are the 0..1 sawtooth ramps of leg A and leg B (leg B half a period later), DA / DB the commanded duties of the legs."Â»
  «text (0,3400) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿All outputs are low for t < 1 ns so the operating point is found with the FETs off (pwm_top / pwm_bot are .func on the top sheet)."Â»
